# source: Huawei Cloud public serverless traces 2025, Region 5, day 30: A. Joosen et al., "Serverless Cold Starts and Where to Find Them", EuroSys 2025, doi:10.1145/3689031.3696073; https://github.com/sir-lab/data-release; licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Converted by bench/sched/huawei_trace.py.
